    "detailed_description": "Singles' Generation is a visual novel story, which follows the life of a group of young friends, including their successes and failures in finding happiness and love, and finding their place in today\u2019s fast-paced, modern world.<br>The game is heavily inspired by fan favourite sitcoms and tells the stories of the friends in a humorous way, in an episodic form.<br><br>Features:<br>-10 episodes<br>-40+ characters to meet throughout the story<br>-Several outfits for all characters<br>-Hundreds of photos to reflect the emotions and reactions of the characters in every situations<br>-Humorous dialogues<br>-Adjustable text speed to match your reading ability<br>-Optional audience reactions for a more immersive sitcom experience<br><br><br>Theme Song:<br>&quot;I Don't Know&quot; by The Tomboys<br>The song is licensed under a Creative Commons License.<br>",
